## 3. What is *not* included

This repository contains **no figures, tables, or extended quotations from any published
paper**. Every figure is generated from formulas or parameters stated in the paper being
discussed, by scripts that live in `scripts/`.

Short quotations used for scholarly comment are attributed inline and listed in
`verify/refs.bib`. Where the full text of a paper was not available, the manuscript says so and
does not quote it.

Third-party trademarks and book titles remain the property of their owners. This book is an
independent work of commentary and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any of
the authors or publishers discussed.

## 4. Disclaimer

This book is a work of intellectual history and methodology. It is not investment advice, not a
recommendation of any security, product, or strategy, and not a promise of any financial
outcome. Every method discussed has preconditions, and every one of them fails outside those
preconditions. The appendices state where.
